nfig/poc-v118.json:88:    \"model\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\npoc/config/poc-v118.json:91:    \"max_output_tokens\": 4000\npoc/config/poc-v118.json:94:    \"model\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\npoc/config/poc-v118.json:97:    \"max_output_tokens\": 4000\nsrc/hivemind/model.py:32:# gpt-6-luna: the published standard rates on 2026-10-25 (developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6-luna: $0.10/M input, $0.50/M output,\nsrc/hivemind/model.py:35:PRICES = {'gpt-6-luna': (0.10, 0.50), 'gpt-6.1-sol': (2.00, 10.00), 'gpt-6-astra': (10.00, 50.00), 'claude-opus-5-5': (4.00, 20.00), 'deepseek-flash': (0.30, 1.20), 'deepseek-v4-pro': (1.32, 3.96),\nsrc/hivemind/model.py:37:CACHED_INPUT_SHARE = 0.10          # cached input tokens are priced at 10% of the input rate (gpt-6-luna page, read again 2026-10-27)\nsrc/hivemind/model.py:123:        request['max_completion_tokens'] = setting.max_output_tokens\nsrc/hivemind/model.py:127:        request['max_tokens'] = setting.max_output_tokens\nsrc/hivemind/model.py:131:def openai_transport(provider, request, timeout=180, max_attempts=3):   # the default preserves the production retry behavior\nsrc/hivemind/model.py:139:    for attempt in range(max_attempts):\nsrc/hivemind/model.py:255:    hit = archive.lookup(sha)\nsrc/hivemind/model.py:271:        raise SchemaError(f'malformed answer: {error}')\nsrc/hivemind/model.py:277:    price_in, price_out = PRICES.get(setting.model, (0.0, 0.0))\nsrc/hivemind/model.py:285:        raise SchemaError('; '.join(errors[:5]))\ndocs/research/2026-11-20-production-readiness/dependency-probe/design.md:42:- **Pass:** changed reconciles in at least 2 of 3 samples in each draw; control reconciles in at most 1 of 3 in at least two draws\ndocs/research/2026-11-20-production-readiness/dependency-probe/probe.py:25:SEND_DRAWS = ('old-2',)                                # council round 3: the only draw whose shown total carries both FY and Q4\ndocs/research/2026-11-20-production-readiness/dependency-probe/probe.py:88:            if draw not in SEND_DRAWS:\ndocs/research/2026-11-20-production-readiness/dependency-probe/reading-rule.md:4:1. **old-2 only decides.** `probe.py` sends only old-2 (`SEND_DRAWS`): control (the stored 09-20 request of v9, byte-equal) and\ndocs/research/2026-11-20-production-readiness/dependency-probe/reading-rule.md:20:- **D.** Room for the rest of NVIDIA: v14's shown figures minus the Data Center figures leave at least $25B for FY2027 and at least\ndocs/research/2026-11-20-production-readiness/dependency-probe/reading-rule.md:27:- **Pass:** changed reconciles in at least 2 of 3; control reconciles in at most 1 of 3; no added refusal (first attempts compared).\ndocs/research/2026-11-20-production-readiness/dependency-probe/reading-rule.md:28:- **Inconclusive:** control reconciles in 2 or 3 of 3 (the stored contradiction is a coin flip here), or changed has 2 or more\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
